{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45112","headline":"兵马曹季良宅夜集 · 皎然","name":"兵马曹季良宅夜集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清景不可失，寻君趣有余。\n身高避事後，道长问心初。\n出处名则异，游从迹何疎。\n吟看刻尽烛，笑卷读残书。\n露彩生笔砚，风音入庭除。\n平明仙侣散，觳觫动回车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}